  "body": [
    "University of Nottingham",
    "Study with us",
    "Get ready to change what's next. Nottingham is the top UK university for graduates entering highly skilled jobs – and has been for the past six years (HESA Graduate Outcomes 2026).",
    "Visit our beautiful campuses and see for yourself why we're the top Russell Group university for work experience (HigheriN 2026/27).",
    "We have a dedicated team to answer any questions about our courses, applying to study with us, and student support (including mental health and disability support).",
